  <div style="position:relative;aspect-ratio:16/9;overflow:hidden;background:#0d0d0d;">
    <img src="assets/work.jpg" alt="Baker Concrete Co. - finished concrete driveway with exposed aggregate finish" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;" loading="eager">
    <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,0) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,0.7) 100%);pointer-events:none;"></div>
    <div style="position:absolute;bottom:clamp(2rem,5vw,4rem);left:clamp(1rem,5vw,5rem);right:clamp(1rem,5vw,5rem);z-index:1;color:#fff;pointer-events:none;">
      <p class="k" style="color:var(--acc-hi);">Our Work</p>
      <h2 class="h1" style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.5rem);margin:.5rem 0 1rem;color:#fff;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;">Finished concrete that lasts</h2>
      <p class="d" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);max-width:60ch;font-size:clamp(1rem,1.4vw,1.15rem);">Exposed aggregate driveways, board-marked walls, polished slabs — every pour struck clean and cured right.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" id="approach" aria-labelledby="ap-t">
  <p class="kick" aria-hidden="true">Approach</p>
  <h2 class="h2" id="ap-t">Crafted with intent</h2>
  <p class="lead">Every pour starts with the formwork. We set tight, true formwork, place with discipline, and strike clean - revealing board-marked faces, crisp arrises, and surfaces that don't need explaining. The finish is in the setup.</p>
  
  <div class="about">
    <div class="about__art rv">
      <canvas id="detailCanvas" width="560" height="320" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
      <p class="about__cap">// FORMWORK STRIKE DETAIL - panel peel revealing board-marked face</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="about__lis">
      <li class="rv">Formwork set plumb, braced and sealed - no blowouts, no bleed lines.</li>
      <li class="rv">Concrete placed in lifts, consolidated properly, finished to the specified texture.</li>
      <li class="rv">Control joints cut to plan, curing managed - no plastic shrinkage cracks.</li>
      <li class="rv">Formwork struck at the right window - board grain reads clean, arris holds sharp.</li>
      <li class="rv">Site left clean. The work speaks for itself.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
<div data-ux="marquee" class="ux-strip" style="overflow:hidden;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);padding:15px 0;background:#0b0d10"><div style="display:flex;gap:2.4rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:13.5px;color:#99a1ae;white-space:nowrap"><span>Slabs</span><span class="uxdot" style="color:var(--acc,#4a5a6a)">·</span><span>Driveways</span><span class="uxdot" style="color:var(--acc,#4a5a6a)">·</span><span>Paths and patios</span><span class="uxdot" style="color:var(--acc,#4a5a6a)">·</span><span>Exposed aggregate</span><span class="uxdot" style="color:var(--acc,#4a5a6a)">·</span><span>Decorative finishes</span><span class="uxdot" style="color:var(--acc,#4a5a6a)">·</span></div></div>


<section class="sec sec--panel" id="services" aria-labelledby="s-t">
  <div class="inner">
    <p class="kick" aria-hidden="true">What we pour</p>
    <h2 class="h2" id="s-t">Slabs, driveways, paths and more</h2>
    <p class="lead">Architectural concrete across the Surf Coast, Bellarine Peninsula and Geelong - residential and light commercial.</p>
    <div class="svc">
      <article class="svc__it rv" data-ux="spotlight"><p class="svc__n">01</p><h3 class="svc__h">Slabs</h3><p class="svc__p">House slabs, shed slabs, suspended slabs - formed, reinforced and finished to spec.</p></article>
      <article class="svc__it rv" data-ux="spotlight"><p class="svc__n">02</p><h3 class="svc__h">Driveways</h3><p class="svc__p">Plain, coloured or exposed aggregate driveways with controlled joints and proper falls.</p></article>
      <article class="svc__it rv" data-ux="spotlight"><p class="svc__n">03</p><h3 class="svc__h">Paths and patios</h3><p class="svc__p">Garden paths, courtyards, alfresco slabs - broomed, trowelled or exposed aggregate finishes.</p></article>
      <article class="svc__it rv" data-ux="spotlight"><p class="svc__n">04</p><h3 class="svc__h">Exposed aggregate</h3><p class="svc__p">Seeded and washed finishes - stone selection, wash timing and sealing done right.</p></article>
      <article class="svc__it rv" data-ux="spotlight"><p class="svc__n">05</p><h3 class="svc__h">Decorative finishes</h3><p class="svc__p">Burnished, polished, coloured oxides, stencilled and custom texture work.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

